---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import MapView from "../components/MapView.astro";
---
<Base title="map | ghost-watts" pathname="/map">
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-8 pb-4">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-500 mb-2 font-mono">map · 61 cities · refreshed quarterly</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-3 leading-tight">Where rooftop solar is growing in Meralco's franchise.</h1>
    <p class="text-ink-700 max-w-prose leading-relaxed">
      We look at each city's rooftops from satellite and compare them to 2022. New solar panels make rooftops <strong>darker</strong> and <strong>cooler in midday sun</strong>. Cities where lots of roofs changed that way score high. <strong>Stronger blue = more solar growth.</strong> Click any city for the rank, the LGU permit cost, and the satellite signal details. <a href="/methodology" class="no-underline text-accent-steel">How we computed this</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <MapView />

  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 text-xs text-ink-500">
    Aggregate framing only. No address-level claims. No PII. Cite as: ghost-watts (YYYY-QN), https://github.com/xmpuspus/ghost-watts. CC-BY-4.0 on data.
  </section>
</Base>
